<BaseLayout title="Driveshaft" description="Driveshaft adapter, yoke, and length notes for LS Genesis Coupe swaps.">
  <h1>Driveshaft</h1>
  <p>
    You'll need a 3-bolt to 4-bolt adapter for the Genesis differential. I used the <a href="https://collinsadapters.com/review/product/list/id/105/category/31/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Collins adapter</a>.
    Note: only the <strong>Spicer 3-2-119</strong> yoke works — the others they list will not.
  </p>
  <p>
    I ordered my driveshaft from Ron Wicks at PST (Precision Shaft Technologies): 3.5" aluminum with a Strange front yoke.
    Your driveshaft length depends on the transmission and engine mounts you use.
  </p>
